Round 3 Promt :

You are a senior full-stack software engineer experienced in secure authentication systems.

Build a production user authentication web app.

Tech Stack
- Frontend: React + TypeScript
- Backend: Node.js / Express
- Database: PostgreSQL
- Authentication: JWT
- Password hashing: bcrypt

Core Features
1. User registration
2. User login
3. Password reset
4. Password change
5. Protected routes
6. Logout

Registration Requirements
- Validate name, email, password, and confirmPassword
- Name is required
- Email must be valid
- Password must be at least 8 characters
- Password must include:
  - 1 uppercase letter
  - 1 lowercase letter
  - 1 number
- confirmPassword must match password
- Check if the user already exists
- Hash password with bcrypt before saving

Login Requirements
- Validate email format
- Compare password with hashed password
- Return JWT token after successful login
- Token expires in 24 hours

Password Reset
- Add forgot password 
- Allow user to set a new password
- New password must follow the same password rules

Security Requirements
- Never store plain text passwords
- Use generic login error: "Invalid email or password"
- Add rate limiting: max 5 failed login attempts per hour
- Lock account temporarily after too many failed attempts
- Validate all user inputs

API Endpoints
Create these endpoints:

- POST /api/auth/register
- POST /api/auth/login
- POST /api/auth/forgot-password
- POST /api/auth/reset-password
- POST /api/auth/change-password
- POST /api/auth/logout

